{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56679","headline":"五言诗 四 · 无名氏","name":"五言诗 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"主人不相识，独坐对林[泉]（全）。\n莫慢愁酤酒，怀中自有钱。\n（以上三诗皆见长沙铜官窰唐代瓷器题诗，录自香港《大公报》一九八五年十月二十六日刊传举有《长沙窰新发现的唐诗》一文。\n该文承任半塘先生录示。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56679.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56679","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}